From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Birk Skyum <birk.skyum@pm.me>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 17:12:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] platform/surface: aggregator_registry: Add the Surface Laptop
 8 15-inch

The 15-inch model's ACPI tables describe the same Surface Aggregator
Module (MSHW0084) and the same SSDT as the 13.8-inch model's, so its
keyboard, fan and platform profile are the Surface Laptop 7's set as
well. Give it that node group.

Signed-off-by: Birk Skyum <birk.skyum@pm.me>
---
 drivers/platform/surface/surface_aggregator_registry.c | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/platform/surface/surface_aggregator_registry.c b/drivers/platform/surface/surface_aggregator_registry.c
index d0e9e70..2d1df5b 100644
--- a/drivers/platform/surface/surface_aggregator_registry.c
+++ b/drivers/platform/surface/surface_aggregator_registry.c
@@ -532,6 +532,8 @@ static const struct of_device_id ssam_platform_hub_of_match[] __maybe_unused = {
 	{ .compatible = "microsoft,romulus15", (void *)ssam_node_group_sl7 },
 	/* Surface Laptop 8th Edition (13.8") */
 	{ .compatible = "microsoft,surface-laptop-8-13p8", (void *)ssam_node_group_sl7 },
+	/* Surface Laptop 8th Edition (15") */
+	{ .compatible = "microsoft,surface-laptop-8-15", (void *)ssam_node_group_sl7 },
 	{ },
 };
 
